18:11.720 --> 18:14.110
Roti bijian goreng!
Jual roti bijian goreng!

18:14.110 --> 18:15.240
Roti bijian goreng!

18:15.270 --> 18:16.670
Jual roti bijian goreng!

18:16.720 --> 18:19.030
Dua pitis satu!

18:21.270 --> 18:22.110
Jom.

18:24.000 --> 18:25.480
Tuan muda nak beli roti bijian goreng?

18:25.480 --> 18:26.480
Dua pitis satu.

18:32.470 --> 18:33.270
Tauke,

18:33.790 --> 18:34.510
awak cuma perlu

18:34.510 --> 18:35.840
jawab satu soalan saya,

18:36.110 --> 18:38.880
