- Mak!

18:48.510 --> 18:49.510
- Mak!
- Mak

18:49.510 --> 18:50.790
Ayah!

18:50.790 --> 18:52.650
Mak!

18:52.680 --> 18:53.880
Saya sangat rindui mak!

18:53.880 --> 18:55.350
Mak!

18:55.720 --> 18:56.550
Yuanbao!

18:59.320 --> 19:00.520
[Keadilan yang Luhur]
[Laksanakan Undang-undang secara Adil]

19:00.110 --> 19:01.110
Yuanbao!

19:01.110 --> 19:02.040
- Yuanbao!
- Mak!

19:02.550 --> 19:03.420
Mak!

19:03.720 --> 19:05.240
- Yuanbao!
- Saya rindui mak!

19:05.240 --> 19:05.960
Anak mak.

19:05.960 --> 19:07.640
Saya rindui mak.

19:07.880 --> 19:09.110
Mak pun rindui awak.

19:09.110 --> 19:10.200
